# arm feature-registration golden
# schema: arm-feature-registration-v1
# Regenerate only with an explicit flag. This test does not rewrite the
# fixture unless one of these commands is used:
#   bazel run //intrinsic_control/intrinsic/icon/control/parts/testing:arm_feature_registration_golden_test -- --update_golden
#   UPDATE_ARM_FEATURE_REGISTRATION_GOLDEN=1 bazel run //intrinsic_control/intrinsic/icon/control/parts/testing:arm_feature_registration_golden_test
# Policy: byte-for-byte. Added, removed, or renumbered FeatureInterfaceTypes
# fail until that command is run and a senior owner reviews the result.
# register_as_compatible records the HalArmPart registration entry point.

